# The tuner and the amplifier through the radio processor, with the
# kit's frames (radio_tune, radio_volume), checked in the status block
# it sends by itself (bytes 4 and 5 the frequency in 50 kHz, 33 the
# source, 34 the volume).  A unit left on FM 88.9 (06 f2) at volume 14:
# to 101.1 (07 e6), volume 10, and back.
info 0
radio on
wait 4000
toradio 82 03 02 07 e6
wait 4000
toradio 19 01 0a
wait 4000
toradio 82 03 02 06 f2
wait 3000
toradio 19 01 0e
wait 4000
radio off
info 4
info 9
